  "semanticReviewPoints": [
    "Distinguish mass and density; preserve 20cm³,2.70g/cm³,7.87g/cm³,54.0g,157.4g and10cm³ activity.",
    "Distinguish elasticity/plasticity, hardness/toughness; do not authorize material substitution.",
    "Preserve quenching/tempering/annealing and specified full-process checks, no recipe creation.",
    "Preserve lathe workpiece rotation vs milling tool rotation and approved-process distinction.",
    "Distinguish grinding dimensional removal and polishing appearance; preserve training boundaries.",
    "Distinguish welding/casting/plastic forming; preserve process-specific hazards.",
    "Preserve Ra0.8μm vs Rz3.2μm non-comparability, stylus handling and separate dimensional acceptance.",
    "Preserve V=I×R,24V/12Ω=2A,24V/24Ω=1A;18V/9Ω and18Ω paper-only activity; ammeter-series vs voltmeter-parallel and short-circuit hazard.",
    "Preserve hollow vs constant-section product distinction, resin cooling vs reaction curing.",
    "Preserve electrostatic vs bath electrodeposition, grounding/ventilation/SDS and no mixing.",
    "Preserve packaging label readability vs correctness and protective limitations.",
    "Preserve6.0→4.5mm=25%;8.0→6.4mm practice, no authorization of actual rolling reduction.",
    "Preserve rolling oil vs postprocess separation; extrusion too-low/too-high temperature hazards, die vs runout-table candidate causes."
